* Using an item pauses the process of entering stealth mode but does not reset it. Once the use animation of the item is finished, it takes {{duration|5 ticks}} before the process resumes.
* Stealth mode fades quickly once the player starts moving, depending on the player's movement speed.{{source code ref|v=1.4.4.9|method=Terraria.Player.Update}} For instance, when moving at a steady {{mph|2 pixels}}, it takes {{duration|floor(1/(0.0075*2)) ticks}}<!-- +0.0075 every tick multiplied by velocity, going from 0 to 1 --> to fully exit stealth mode, whereas it only takes {{duration|floor(1/(0.0075*10)) ticks}} when moving at {{mph|10 pixels}}.<!-- Note that this is not entirely accurate because the acceleration from standstill to those velocity values is not accounted for. This is only meant to demonstrate that the time to leave stealth mode depends on move speed. -->
